# 63. Agent Implementation Instructions

Before writing code:

1. Inspect the existing repository.
2. Confirm the existing Next.js structure.
3. Confirm the shadcn preset is installed.
4. Inspect the existing theme variables.
5. Inspect existing shadcn components.
6. Do not replace the existing theme.
7. Install Motion for React.
8. Establish the i18n and RTL architecture.
9. Establish the Quran data model.
10. Establish the scheduler as independent business logic.

Implement in logical phases.

Do not create one enormous component.

Do not duplicate UI for Arabic and English.

Use translation dictionaries.

Use one shared component system.

Use direction-aware CSS.

Use logical CSS properties where appropriate.

For example:

ms instead of ml

me instead of mr

ps instead of pl

pe instead of pr

text-start instead of hard-coded left/right

