# 64. Critical Design Instruction

The schedule is the most important screen in the application.

Spend the most design attention there.

It must look like something a user would genuinely want to:

Save

Screenshot

Print

Send to WhatsApp

Share with friends

The schedule must not look like an admin dashboard.

It should feel like a carefully designed Quran reading plan.

Use the existing shadcn design system as the foundation and Motion to add subtle movement.

Do not sacrifice readability for visual effects.

