# 65. Final Product Direction

Wirddy is not a Quran reader.

It is not a Quran search engine.

It is not primarily a social network.

It is a Quran group planning tool.

Its core promise is:

Create your group.

Tell Wirddy what everyone can read.

Tell Wirddy how much everyone should read.

Choose how many weeks.

Wirddy creates the complete rotating Quran plan.

The user should be able to understand the product within seconds.

The final experience should feel polished enough to be a real standalone product, while remaining extremely simple to use.
